<title>USA: Amcon Distributing Q1 shr $0.40 vs $0.12.</title>
<headline>Amcon Distributing Q1 shr $0.40 vs $0.12.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA, Neb. 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>			  First quarter ended December 31</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $	 0.40	   $	 0.12</p>
<p>Net income</p>
<p>attributable</p>
<p>to common</p>
<p>  shareholders		977			300</p>
<p> Sales		     41,400		    41,300</p>
<p>NOTES: Full company name is Amcon Distributing Co.</p>
<p>The increase in net income was primarily the result of the gain associated with the sale of the company's beer distributorship in Denver, Colo., which after expenses related to the closing of the facility was about $500,000 after-tax, and the result reduced operating expenses achieved from the company's consolidation program.</p>
<p>--((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
